# Hybris fallbacks for Galaxy S10 5G (beyondx), Android 16 base.
# init.boringssl.zygote64_32.rc runs these (from the conscrypt APEX) once apexd is ready and
# reboots the phone if they are missing/fail. This directory is parsed first, so these stubs
# win if the APEX service definitions are unavailable.
service boringssl_self_test_apex32 /system/bin/true
    user nobody
    oneshot
    disabled

service boringssl_self_test_apex64 /system/bin/true
    user nobody
    oneshot
    disabled
